; The existing private-socketpair Home is part of the trusted Linux frontend,
; not an Android application or a generic native application launcher.
; Only root-owned immutable binaries admitted as compositor_exec can execute
; without transition inside that frontend's existing domain. NNP/capability
; constraints remain inherited; unlabeled executables and appdomain are excluded.
; This deliberately does not claim isolation between compositor and Home.
(allow archtv_compositor archtv_compositor_exec (file (execute_no_trans)))
